---
// The portable artifact. Every engagement ends in one attestation document,
// independent and tagged to the frameworks an enterprise security review
// already checks. The real report (GitHub Copilot coding agent, BSTN-GHCP-
// 2026-06-R11) is the visual; the steps walk the reader through what makes it
// the thing a founder can hand across the table.
---

<section class="report" id="artifact">
  <div class="page">
    <header class="head">
      <p class="label">The artifact</p>
      <h2>What you can walk in a room with</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        Every engagement ends in one document. We ran the attacks, so we wrote it.
        It is dated, scoped, and tagged to the frameworks a security team already checks.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid">
      <figure class="doc">
        <img
          src="/assets/shot-report.webp"
          width="1500"
          height="2600"
          alt="Attestation report BSTN-GHCP-2026-06-R11 for the GitHub Copilot coding agent: scope, allowed and forbidden actions, and every finding mapped to OWASP LLM, OWASP Agentic, and NIST AI RMF controls."
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <figcaption class="tnum">Report BSTN-GHCP-2026-06-R11</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <span class="n tnum">01</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Independent</h3>
            <p>We ran the engagement and wrote the report. The customer did not fill in a form.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="n tnum">02</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Scoped before the first probe</h3>
            <p>What the agent may do, and what it may never do, written down up front and tested against.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="n tnum">03</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Mapped to the controls they check</h3>
            <p>Every finding tagged to OWASP LLM, OWASP Agentic, and NIST AI RMF at collection time.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="n tnum">04</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Re-attestable</h3>
            <p>Change the system, re-run the suite, the document updates. A point-in-time scan cannot.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="cta-li">
          <a class="cta" href="/contact">Book a scoping call →</a>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .report {
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--stone-line);
  }

  .head {
    max-width: 46ch;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }

  .label {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold-text);
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 1.2rem + 2vw, 2.6rem);
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
    max-width: 18ch;
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 0.97rem + 0.3vw, 1.15rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
    }
  }

  /* the document. real report, clipped and dissolving into the page so it reads
     as one page of a longer thing. */
  .doc {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--stone-line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    max-height: 660px;
    background: #fff;
    box-shadow:
      0 -1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6) inset,
      0 30px 80px -34px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
  }

  .doc img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .doc::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    height: 160px;
    pointer-events: none;
    background: linear-gradient(to top, var(--bone) 6%, rgba(16, 15, 13, 0) 100%);
  }

  .doc figcaption {
    position: absolute;
    left: 14px;
    bottom: 12px;
    z-index: 1;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .steps {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    position: sticky;
    top: 90px;
  }

  .steps li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-block: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.4rem);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--stone-line);
  }

  .steps li:first-child {
    border-top: 0;
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .n {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--gold-text);
    padding-top: 0.2rem;
    min-width: 1.6rem;
  }

  .steps h3 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 0.3rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .steps p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  .cta-li {
    padding-top: clamp(1.2rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem) !important;
  }

  .cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    height: 2.4rem;
    padding-inline: 1.1rem;
    background: var(--gold);
    color: #100f0d;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: background-color 150ms ease;
  }

  .cta:hover {
    background: var(--gold-lift);
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .steps {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
